 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！今天，我们来学运动。"
    },
    {
     "en": "sports"
    },
    {
     "zh": "运动，体育。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:sports",
    "focus:sports"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "跑跑跳跳、打球踢球，这些都是运动："
    },
    {
     "en": "sports"
    },
    {
     "zh": "运动有很多很多种，所以这个词常常带着字母 s。"
    },
    {
     "en": "I love sports!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:run",
    "edge:sports>run",
    "focus:run"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最简单的运动是跑步。还记得第七集学过的吗？"
    },
    {
     "en": "run"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:race",
    "edge:run>race",
    "focus:race"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "大家站在同一条起跑线上，比一比谁跑得快，就是赛跑："
    },
    {
     "en": "race"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's have a race!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:jump",
    "edge:sports>jump",
    "focus:jump"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "两只脚用力一蹬，跳起来："
    },
    {
     "en": "jump"
    },
    {
     "en": "Jump high!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:fall",
    "edge:jump>fall",
    "focus:fall"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "哎呀，没站稳，摔倒了！摔倒、落下，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "fall"
    },
    {
     "zh": "如果是已经摔倒了，要说成",
     "cue": [
      "alt:fall"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "fell"
    },
    {
     "zh": "把字母 a 换成 e，就变成过去发生的事啦。"
    },
    {
     "en": "He fell down."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:ball",
    "edge:sports>ball",
    "focus:ball"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "很多运动，都离不开一个圆圆的球："
    },
    {
     "en": "ball"
    },
    {
     "en": "Catch the ball!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:football",
    "edge:ball>football",
    "focus:football"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "用脚踢的球，是足球。还记得上一集的脚吗？脚加上球："
    },
    {
     "en": "foot"
    },
    {
     "en": "ball"
    },
    {
     "en": "football"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:soccer",
    "edge:football>soccer",
    "focus:soccer"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "在美国，足球还有另外一个名字："
    },
    {
     "en": "soccer"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's play soccer."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:basketball",
    "edge:ball>basketball",
    "focus:basketball"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "把球投进高高的篮筐里，是篮球。篮子，加上球："
    },
    {
     "en": "basket"
    },
    {
     "en": "basketball"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:volleyball",
    "edge:ball>volleyball",
    "focus:volleyball"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "隔着一张网，用手把球拍来拍去，是排球："
    },
    {
     "en": "volleyball"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:tabletennis",
    "edge:ball>tabletennis",
    "focus:tabletennis"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "在桌子上打的小小的球，是乒乓球。桌子，加上网球："
    },
    {
     "en": "table"
    },
    {
     "en": "tennis"
    },
    {
     "en": "table tennis"
    }
